OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm 28 and training to play my
OL,4,Athird professional sport'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJacob Smillie is only 28 - yet he has
OL,7,Falready had a whirlwind career in elite
OL,8,Fsport.
OL,10,FSmillie, from Bradford, has represented
OL,11,FJamaica at rugby union, played
OL,12,Fprofessional rugby league, and lived in
OL,13,FGermany and Poland after signing for
OL,14,FAmerican football teams.
OL,16,FIn September he made his debut as a
OL,17,Fprofessional wrestler.
OL,19,F"I've always been a massive fan of
OL,20,Fwrestling - so for me it was only a
OL,21,Fmatter of time," he said.
